Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: loongarch/filter_lsx_intrinsics.c
Line: 180
Function: png_read_filter_row_sub3_lsx
Bug type: out-of-bounds-read
CWE: CWE-125
Explanation: __lsx_vldrepl_w(nxt, 0) performs a 4-byte load unconditionally on a 3-bytes-per-pixel row. For a 1-pixel-wide RGB row (rowbytes == 3), this reads 1 byte past the end of the buffer.

